    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><b>scala_program</b>: a Scala 3 "write a program" question type.</p>
<p>The student's answer is a complete Scala 3 program: either a top-level
<code>@main def name(): Unit</code> or an <code>object</code> with
<code>def main(args: Array[String]): Unit</code>. Each test supplies <em>standard input</em>
and the program's output is compared exactly with the expected output. Read input with
<code>scala.io.StdIn.readLine()</code>.</p>
<p>If the answer has several entry points, set the sandbox parameters to
<code>{"main_class": "Name"}</code>. Compiler warnings do not fail an answer; set
<code>{"compileargs": ["-Werror"]}</code> to make them fatal.</p>]]></text>
